  "candidate_doc": "Residual-as-GEMM-C candidate.\n\nHypothesis: the attention-output and FFN-output residual additions are launch-bound\non the target small-width cases.  Instead of producing a biased projection and\nlaunching a separate residual add, this implementation precombines the projection\nbias with the residual and supplies that tensor as the C operand of addmm.  cuBLAS\nthen performs the residual accumulation inside the projection GEMM (beta=1),\nremoving the post-projection residual-add dependency and making the next LayerNorm\navailable directly from the GEMM result.",
